        {
          "text": "Abrahamu akaongeza kusema, “Ee Bwana, naomba usinikasirikie, nami nitasema tena. Huenda wakapatikana watu wema thelathini.” Mwenyezi-Mungu akamjibu, “Sitafanya hivyo nikiwakuta hao thelathini.”",
